 mposium)  If you are unable to attend in person or via the live stream\, 
 please email deliaweidman@lclark.edu (mailto:deliaweidman@lclark.edu) to 
 receive a recording of the event.Schedule of Events7:45am | Continental B
 reakfast and Check-In8:15am | Introduction and Welcome:Janice Weis\,Assoc
 iate Dean\, Environmental Law Program\, Lewis &amp\; Clark Law School8:30
 am | KeynoteSenator Janeen Sollman\,Senate District 15Oregon State Legisl
 ature9:00-10:30 | Panel 1 – The International LandscapePanelists:Robert
  Adler– Dean Emeritus and Distinguished Professor Emeritus\, University
