 lle Nowlin</strong></a><strong>– Clinical Professor of Law and Co-Direc
 tor of the Environmental Law and Policy Clinic at Duke University Law Sch
 ool. Presenting&#160\;<em><strong>Regulatory Challenges and Solutions to 
