 raft article (not for circulation).</strong></a><strong>Presenting&#160\;
 <em>The Landscape of U.S. Plastic Litigation: Litigation Pathways to Addr
 ess a Global Crisis.</em></strong></li><li><a href="https://www.kellerroh
 rback.com/attorney/daniel-mensher"><strong>Dan Mensher</strong></a> '07 <
 strong>– Attorney at Keller Rohrback LLP. Presenting <em>Plastic Litiga
 tion for Plastic Problems: The Practical Opportunities and Challenges of 
 Using Lawsuits to Address this Mess.</em></strong></li></ul><p style="pad
 ding-left: 40px\;"><strong><i>Moderator:</i></strong><strong>Professor Th
 omas Buchele – Lewis &amp\; Clark Law School</strong></p><p><strong>3:0
 0-3:15 Break</strong></p><p><strong>3:15-4:45 | Panel 4 – Hot Topics</s
