SUMMARY:Portland Panorama Basecamp
DESCRIPTION:Portland’s largest film festival is back! Portland Panorama returns for 11 days\, April 9-19th with over 120 films from around the world\, 100+ visiting filmmakers\, parties\, panels\, live music & more! \nPanorama Basecamp acts as the central hub for the festival. This is where all passholders check in\, pick up credentials\, and get oriented for the days ahead. Festival staff are available onsite to help with ticketing questions\, event navigation\, and recommendations. All passholders must pick up a physical pass at Basecamp. \nBasecamp Details\nKGW Studio in The Square\n701 SW 6th Ave.\nPortland\, OR 97204 \nFor a list of venues and to secure tickets\, CLICK HERE.
