DESCRIPTION:<p>==========</p><p><b>Due to popular interest\, this event is 
 <u>full and closed</u></b>. Please consider any of our other open events --
  we hope to work with you soon!</p><p>==========</p><p>Let's plant trees to
 gether in Wilsonville!  Interested in receiving a tree? Click <b><u><a href
 ="https://friendsoftrees.org/get-a-tree/" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u
 ><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>HERE</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u><
 /u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a></u></b> to purchase a tree for your hou
 sehold. Dozens of large (6-10' tall) trees will be ready for planting in th
 eir new homes\, and your help is what makes this community planting possibl
 e!</p><p>Please arrive by 8:45am to sign-in and be assigned a planting crew
 . The planting starts at 9:00am. We provide gloves\, tools\, and guidance\,
  as well as light breakfast snacks and coffee/tea/hot chocolate. We ask tha
 t all volunteers dress for the weather\, wear sturdy shoes/boots you don't 
 mind getting dirty\, and be ready to have fun!</p><p><b>Under age 18?</b> W
 e request that youth 15 and under volunteer with a parent/guardian.  Youth 
 16 and older can volunteer on their own and will need to hand us a <b><u><a
  href="http://friendsoftrees.org/youthwaiver" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><
 u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>youth waiver form</u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a></u></b> signed by thei
 r parent/guardian.</p><p><b>Private transportation</b>: You will travel fro
 m the meeting location to a few planting sites in the nearby neighborhood (
 up to several miles). <b>We recommend private transportation</b> (bike or v
 ehicle)\, but there may be an option to carpool if others in your small pla
 nting crew are also comfortable with this. </p><p><b>Questions?  </b>Pl<u><
 /u>ease check out our <a href="https://friendsoftrees.org/volunteer-faq/" t
 arget="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b><u>Volunteer FAQ webpage
 </u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a>.  Our team is also
  happy to assist! <a href="mailto:Volunteer@friendsoftrees.org" target="_bl
 ank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b><u>volunteer@fr<u></u>iendsoftrees
 .or<u></u>g</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a> / 503-5
 95-0213 We look forward to working together soon!<br></p><p>===</p><p>Thank
  you to our event sponsor\, <a href="https://portlandgeneral.com/" target="
 _blank"><u><u><u>Portland General Electric</u></u></u></a>.</p><p>===</p><p
 ><br></p><b><hr /></b><p></p><p>This event in partnership with City of Wils
 onville.</p>
