SUMMARY: Easter Bunny Express Steam Train Ride
DESCRIPTION:All Aboard the Easter Bunny Express!\n\nSpringtime is here\, 
 and it’s time for an egg-citing adventure! Hop aboard a festive Easter-th
 emed steam train ride pulled by the legendary Polson #2 and celebrate the
  season in style.\n\nGuess who’s hopping onboard? The Easter Bunny will b
 e joining the ride to spread joy and cheer! Snap some selfies with the Ea
 ster Bunny\, enjoy fun kids’ activities and a festive scavenger hunt\, an
 d soak in the beauty of the season along the way. It’s the perfect family
  outing to welcome spring!\n\nWhen: Saturday\, April 4 & Sunday\, April 5
 \n\nDeparture Times: 12:00pm | 1:30pm | 3:00pm | 4:30pm\n\nTickets: Adult
 s $24 | Seniors & Military $21.50 | Children $17 | Infants (under age 3) 
 Free | Family Pass $74 (2 Adults & 2 Children)\n\nDon't miss out on this 
 egg-cellent adventure! Book your tickets today https://fareharbor.com/emb
 eds/book/orhf/items/623616/calendar/2026/03/?full-items=yes !
CATEGORIES:Easter,Train-Ride,Family,Kid-Friendly
