DESCRIPTION:This session is intended for those who were unable to attend 
 the initial forum\, as well as anyone who would like to continue the disc
 ussion.  We appreciate the strong interest in these conversations and rem
 ain committed to open communication.&#160\;  If you would like to submit 
 a question in advance\, please continue to use this form (https://www.lcl
 ark.edu/live/forms/1865-submit-your-questions-for-the-budget-forum) (incl
 udes the option to remain anonymous).  We look forward to continuing the 
 conversation.  Staff and faculty are invited to submit questions in advan
 ce of each budget forum. Leadership will do their best to answer all ques
 tions at the in-person forum. There will also be an opportunity to ask qu
 estions at the event. Name is not required to submit a question in advanc
 e below.submit_your_questions_for_thetextarea fieldPlease submit your que
