DESCRIPTION:Marcelo Fontana and Wave Contemporary will transform the Multn
 omah County Central Library into a space for poetic resistance\, inviting 
 the viewer to see hope as an active power rather than a passive wish. Open
 ing Reception: April 4\, 1:00 p.m. to...
