X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/Los_Angeles
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE:https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/675/width/80/heig
 ht/80/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,726\,484/112224_IMG_0098_2.rev.1772212878.j
 pg
X-LIVEWHALE-COST:Free
X-LIVEWHALE-CONTACT-INFO:<p>\n  ADVANCEMENT<br />\n  <br />\n  Andrew McP
 heeters<br />\n  Associate Vice President<br />\n  for Community Educatio
 n &amp\; Travel Programs<br />\n  <br />\n  + (503) 841-7657<br />\n  + &
 #160\;mcpheete@lclark.edu\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  In this online session\, Kim will talk about h
 ow a writing practice can transform a journey\, and share poems written o
 n the road in Ireland Scotland\, Iceland\, and beyond.\n</p>\n<p>\n  <em>
 <span data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-originalcomputedfontsize="18.6666
 66">Join Kim Stafford—poet\, retired professor at Lewis &amp\; Clark Co
 llege\, former Oregon Poet Laureate—to make travel more than seeing the
  sights. He will share how keeping a journal opens doors to deeper\, more
  meaningful connections to the places you</span></em>\n</p>\n<p>\n  &#160
 \;\n</p>\n<p>\n  <span data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-originalcomputed
 fontsize="18.666666"><picture class="lw_image lw_image112232  lw_align_ce
 nter">\n	<source type="image/webp" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/live/im
 age/gid/675/width/392/height/294/112232_IMG_0143.webp 1x" data-origin="re
 sponsive"/>\n	<source type="image/jpeg" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/li
 ve/image/gid/675/width/392/height/294/112232_IMG_0143.rev.1772215739.jpg 
 1x" data-origin="responsive"/>\n	<img alt="" width="392" height="294" dat
 a-alt="" data-decoration="true" src="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gi
 d/675/width/392/height/294/112232_IMG_0143.rev.1772215739.jpg" title="IMG
  0143" data-max-w="600" data-max-h="450" loading="lazy" data-optimized="t
 rue"/>\n</picture><em>Kim will also share a glimpse of his upcoming guide
 d trip to Ireland in September 2026\, where he'll lead travelers to Dubli
 n\, west to Galway\, and north to Belfast\, blending poetry\, history\, w
 ith the quest for peace and discovery. Learn more about the Lewis &amp\; 
 Clark Travel Program <a href="https://college.lclark.edu/offices/alumni/t
 ravel/" data-saferedirecturl="https://www.google.com/url?q=https://colleg
 e.lclark.edu/offices/alumni/travel/&amp\;source=gmail&amp\;ust=1772297740
 447000&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1FRWiYjrTqHShJqJaRzMt7" data-removefontsize="true" 
 data-originalcomputedfontsize="18.666666">here</a>. The deadline for regi
 stration for Ireland is May 7.</em><br /></span>\n</p>\n<h3>\n  <em><span
  data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-originalcomputedfontsize="18.666666"><
 picture class="lw_image lw_image112233  lw_align_center">\n	<source type=
 "image/webp" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/675/width/392/
 height/392/112233_IMG_0140_2.webp 1x" data-origin="responsive"/>\n	<sourc
 e type="image/jpeg" srcset="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/675/wid
 th/392/height/392/112233_IMG_0140_2.rev.1772216061.jpg 1x" data-origin="r
 esponsive"/>\n
	<picture>
	<img alt="" width="392" height="392" data-alt="" data-deco
 ration="true" src="https://www.lclark.edu/live/image/gid/675/width/392/he
 ight/392/112233_IMG_0140_2.rev.1772216061.jpg" title="IMG 0140 2" data-ma
 x-w="768" data-max-h="768" loading="lazy" data-optimized="true"/>
	</picture>\n</pict
 ure></span></em>\n</h3>\n<p>\n  <span data-originalfontsize="14pt" data-o
 riginalcomputedfontsize="18.666666"><br />\n  <br /></span>\n</p>
