SUMMARY:Dead Poets Society: Open Mic
DESCRIPTION:The Literary Arts Bookstore & Cafe cordially invites you to the first annual meeting of the Dead Poets Society\, an open mic for dead people and their enthusiasts. \nThis National Poetry Month\, we’re celebrating the voices of poets from the past. Join us to celebrate the work of your favorite dead poet by sharing it with a crowd—or sit quietly and soak up the vibes. \nThis is an open mic like any other\, except we are asking you to read someone else’s work. (Dead poets only) Original pieces and work by living artists will be turned away. Sign-ups start at 5:30 p.m. Space is limited. \nThis event is free and open to the public.
URL:https://literary-arts.org/event/dead-poets-society-open-mic/
LOCATION:Literary Arts
CATEGORIES:Free Events,Bookstore
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://literary-arts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/DPS-scaled.jpg
GEO:45.5213897;-122.6810304
END:VEVENT
