BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Portland Community College": "https://events.pcc.edu/event/10023-ekphrasis-a-pcc-district-wide-faculty-exhibition"}
X-SOURCE-ID:portland_community_college
X-SOURCE:Portland Community College
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260408
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260409
SUMMARY:Ekphrasis: A PCC District-Wide Faculty Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Exhibition Dates: February 26\, 2026 – April 17\, 2026Galle
 ry hours: Monday – Friday\, 8am-4pm.Opening Reception: Saturday\, Febru
 ary 28\, 5:00 – 8:00 p.m.Additional Events announced soon.Ekphrasis com
 es from the Greek words ek (out) and phrásis (speak)\, literally speakin
 g out. The Poetry Foundation defines an ekphrastic poem as a vivid descri
 ption of a work of art. But ekphrasis is more than giving voice to the vi
 sual\, more than mere description. Ekphrasis offers one's voice in dialog
 ue with another. In Ekphrasis: A PCC Faculty Exhibition\, recent art from
  Portland Community College art faculty and lab techs is positioned in co
 nversation\, both with each other and with writing faculty who composed e
 kphrastic poems about the work.—Event Details: https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp
 ?id=382395 (https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382395)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:Exhibition Dates: February 26\, 2026 – Apr
 il 17\, 2026<br />Gallery hours: Monday – Friday\, 8am-4pm.<br />Openin
 g Reception: Saturday\, February 28\, 5:00 – 8:00 p.m.<br />Additional 
 Events announced soon.<br />Ekphrasis comes from the Greek words ek (out)
  and phrásis (speak)\, literally speaking out. The Poetry Foundation def
 ines an ekphrastic poem as a vivid description of a work of art. But ekph
 rasis is more than giving voice to the visual\, more than mere descriptio
 n. Ekphrasis offers one's voice in dialogue with another. In Ekphrasis: A
  PCC Faculty Exhibition\, recent art from Portland Community College art 
 faculty and lab techs is positioned in conversation\, both with each othe
 r and with writing faculty who composed ekphrastic poems about the work.<
 br />—<br />Event Details: <a href="https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382395"
  target="_blank">https://hub.pcc.edu/rsvp?id=382395</a>
UID:20260408T070000Z-10023@events.pcc.edu
DTSTAMP:20260219T185839Z
URL:https://events.pcc.edu/event/10023-ekphrasis-a-pcc-district-wide-facu
 lty-exhibition
LAST-MODIFIED:20260220T025839Z
X-LIVEWHALE-TYPE:events
X-LIVEWHALE-ID:10023
X-LIVEWHALE-TIMEZONE:America/Los_Angeles
X-LIVEWHALE-ALL-DAY:1
