 ps://bit.ly/ACLbkclub\nOr call 253-215-8782 to join by phone.\nMeeting ID:
  924 6989 8432 & Passcode: 037016\nIf you would like to read ahead\, here 
 is the book club’s schedule for the rest of 2026:\nMay 6th (online) & 7t
 h (in person) -\nHeartwood\nby Amity Gaige\nJune 3rd (online) & 4th (in pe
 rson) -\nThe Anthropocene Reviewed\nby John Green\nJuly & August - Break\n
