 so available in large print\, eBook\, downloadable audiobook\, preloaded a
 udiobook (Playaway)\, and audiobook CD\nIf you would like to read ahead\, 
 here is the book club’s schedule for the rest of 2026:\nMay 6th (online)
  & 7th (in person) -\nHeartwood\nby Amity Gaige\nJune 3rd (online) & 4th (
 in person) -\nThe Anthropocene Reviewed\nby John Green\nJuly & August - Br
 eak\nSeptember 9th (online) & 10th (in person) -\nTress of the Emerald Sea
 \nby Brandon Sanderson\nOctober 7th (online) & 8th (in person) -\nRemarkab
 ly Bright Creatures\nby Shelby Van Pelt\nNovember 4th (online) & 5th (in p
 erson) -\nBad Cree\nby Jessica Johns\nDecember - Break
