DESCRIPTION:Join us for our\nOpen House on Friday\, April 10\,\nfor cake a
 nd refreshments\, prizes\, and fun activities for all ages!\nTechnology pe
 tting zoo from 11:00 a.m. to 12:00 p.m. and 4:00 to 5:00 p.m.\nLook for 
 “golden tickets”\nhidden in the library on April 10. Find one and brin
 g it back to get a $20 Target gift card. We are hiding 5 tickets in total.
 \nAt 12:00 p.m.\, we are holding a\n“ribbon cutting” for our new Meeti
 ng Pod\n. Learn all about how it works and how it can be booked for meetin
 gs and study sessions.\nGames and self-led activities 11:00 a.m. to 5:00 p
 .m. Play large versions of classic games\, enjoy a coloring table\, and pl
 ay on the Nintendo Switch during the technology petting zoo times.\nStop b
 y various stations in the library to\nshare your ideas\n. Fill up your “
 idea card”\, then choose from a selection of prizes and be entered in a 
 raffle to win one of 6 $10 gift cards to the nearby Symposium Coffee.\nAll
  events are free and open to the public.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c57ddd81b67dfe32af2eda
