BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"University Of Portland": "https://calendar.up.edu/event/the-lightning-thief-the-percy-jackson-musical", "Travel Portland": "https://onthestage.tickets/show/university-of-portland1/6883db7da56ded21eb9ba69e/"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"University Of Portland": "https://calendar.up.edu/event/the-lightning-thief-the-percy-jackson-musical"}
X-SOURCE-ID:university_of_portland
X-SOURCE:University Of Portland, Travel Portland
CATEGORIES:Performance
DESCRIPTION:⚡️Ancient myth and teen angst collide in this high-voltage rock
  musical adapted from Rick Riordan’s best-selling novel\, where young peopl
 e learn that the things that make us different are the things that make us 
 strong. \n \nDemigod Percy Jackson has always struggled with fitting in. Wh
 en his single mom must send him where she can’t follow\, he ends up at a su
 mmer camp for kids like him – half Greek god\, half mortal. Joined by a dau
 ghter of Athena trying to prove her worth and a satyr trying to make up for
  past tragedies\, the trio journeys into the underworld and back to reclaim
  Zeus’s stolen lightning bolt and stop a war between the gods. With a whole
  host of mythological creatures chasing after them\, can these unlikely her
 oes shoulder the fate of the world? Maybe Percy can finally find a place wh
 ere he belongs...if he doesn’t die first. This electric coming-of-age story
  will resonate with anyone who’s had trouble finding the courage to stand s
 trong in a world full of monsters.\n\nTickets are on sale now for this incr
 edible show\, running April 8-12 and 15-19. The Lightning Thief will be the
  raucous conclusion to an amazing UPTheater season! Get your tickets now be
 fore they’re gone! 💙 Use code 'FIRST50' for $5 tickets\, and 'PRESALE' for 
 $10 tickets!
DTEND:20260411T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20260403T022344Z
DTSTART:20260411T023000Z
GEO:45.573252;-122.728181
LOCATION:Mago Hunt Center
SEQUENCE:0
SUMMARY:The Lightning Thief: The Percy Jackson Musical
UID:tag:localist.com\,2008:EventInstance_52339988333283
URL:https://calendar.up.edu/event/the-lightning-thief-the-percy-jackson-mus
 ical
END:VEVENT
