BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-ID:friends_of_trees_green_space
X-SOURCE:Friends Of Trees Green Space
DTSTART:20260411T164500Z
DTEND:20260411T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260403T022438Z
UID:5ocq477mhd0e2lesjq2js4mu4s@google.com
CREATED:20260123T230207Z
DESCRIPTION:Your help is needed to mulch hundreds of native pollinator spec
 ies that were planted this past winter at Kelly Butte! We may also take out
  some weedy introduced plants\, if time allows. <u>Note: there will be no t
 ree-planting at this event\, and this can be physically-demanding work</u> 
 (great for folks looking for a work out!).  Our stewardship events help to 
 ensure the highest level of plant survival through the PNW dry summer month
 s ahead.<br><p><b>How do I register? </b>Register by filling out <b><a href
 ="https://www.tfaforms.com/4840511?tfa_26=a0TPa00001Edi8i&tfa_2189=Kelly%20
 Butte%20Stewardship\,%20SE%20Portland&tfa_31=a0VPa00000DfdE7&tfa_45=%20at%2
 0April%2011\,%202026%20at%209:45%20am&tfa_2190=2026-04-11&tfa_49=3.25&tfa_8
 86=Portland%20Parks%20and%20Recreation&tfa_51=offsite" target="_blank"><u><
 u>this quick form</u></u></a></b>.  Groups\, families\, and individuals wel
 come!</p><u></u><p><b>Please arrive by 9:45am</b> to find our tent and sign
 -in\, stewardship activities start promptly at 10:00am. We provide gloves\,
  tools\, and guidance. All you need to do is show up dressed for the weathe
 r and wearing sturdy shoes or boots (no sandals of any kind\, please!) and 
 be ready to have fun!</p><p><b>Under age 18?</b> We request that youth 15 a
 nd under volunteer with a parent/guardian.  Youth 16 and older can voluntee
 r on their own and will need to hand us a <b><a href="https://friendsoftree
 s.org/youthwaiver" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>youth waiver form</
 u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a></b> signed by their parent/guardian.</p><p><
 b>Questions?  </b>Pl<u></u>ease check out our <a href="https://friendsoftre
 es.org/volunteer-faq/" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b>
 <u>Volunteer FAQ webpage</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u
 ></a>.  Our team is also happy to assist! <a href="mailto:Volunteer@friends
 oftrees.org" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b><u>volunte
 er@fr<u></u>iendsoftrees.or<u></u>g</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u>
 </u></u></u></a> / 503-595-0213 We look forward to working together soon!<b
 r></p><hr /><p>This event is in partnership with Portland Parks &amp\; Recr
 eation and Portland OIC.<br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260128T220654Z
LOCATION:Southeast Taggart Street & Southeast 103rd Avenue\, SE Taggart St 
 & SE 103rd Ave\, Portland\, OR 97266\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Kelly Butte Stewardship event (SE Portland\, OR)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
