 s Earth Week Give event to support the Garden Home & West Slope Communit
 y Libraries! Between\nApril 15 - 26\n\, drop off full blue bags from the l
 ibrary at your local bag drop site or donate directly from your Bottle Dro
 p green bag account to the Garden Home Community Library Association. Bott
 le Drop will match 20% of the funds raised through this program. Thank you
