SUMMARY:Senior Degree Recital: Kyra Jorgensen
DESCRIPTION:Kyra has composed 7 pieces loosely based on the seven church 
 modes of the major scale. Based on the 16th card of the Tarot's Major Arc
 ana\, The Tower\, the pieces tell a story of liberation. This performance
  will be live streamed here. (https://vimeo.com/event/4079258)Parking at 
 Lewis &amp\; Clark - For events in Evans Auditorium\, Agnes Flanagan Chap
 el\, or Diane Gregg Pavilion\, enter at Gate 2 and park in Upper Griswold
 \, Lower Griswold\, or Fir Acres Lots (see: campus map (https://www.lclar
 k.edu/live/files/7676-campus-map)).Parking permits are required during th
 e academic year between Monday through Friday\, 7am to 7pm. Please see th
 e Visiting Campus page (https://www.lclark.edu/visit/parking_and_transpor
 tation/visitor_parking/) for additional details. For weekday events befor
 e 7pm\, visitors may purchase day passes online (https://lclark.t2hosted.
 com/Account/Portal) or via QR codes posted in all major parking lots.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Kyra has composed 7 pieces loosely base
 d on the seven church modes of the major scale. Based on the 16th card of
  the Tarot's Major Arcana\, The Tower\, the pieces tell a story of libera
 tion. This performance will be <a href="https://vimeo.com/event/4079258" 
 target="_blank" rel="noopener">live streamed here.</a></p><p><strong>Park
 ing at Lewis &amp\; Clark</strong> - <em>For events in Evans Auditorium\,
  Agnes Flanagan Chapel\, or Diane Gregg Pavilion\, enter at Gate 2 and pa
 rk in Upper Griswold\, Lower Griswold\, or Fir Acres Lots (see: <a href="
 https://www.lclark.edu/live/files/7676-campus-map" target="_blank" rel="n
 oopener">campus map</a>).</em><em>Parking permits are required during the
  academic year between Monday through Friday\, 7am to 7pm. Please see the
  <a href="https://www.lclark.edu/visit/parking_and_transportation/visitor
 _parking/">Visiting Campus page</a> for additional details. For weekday e
 vents before 7pm\, visitors may purchase day passes <a href="https://lcla
 rk.t2hosted.com/Account/Portal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">online</a>
  or via QR codes posted in all major parking lots.</em></p>
