  happening the first week of Spring Term 2026.There will also be the Pass
 ports to Success activity. Complete your passport by collecting stamps an
 d earn a $15 voucher redeemable at any PCC Cafeteria.Spring Week of Welco
 me Student Job Fair &amp\; Passports to Success is happening from 10am–
 2pm daily at the following locations:Monday\, April 13: Rock Creek Bldg 5
  Room 122Tuesday\, April 14: Sylvania CC Main MallWednesday\, April 15: S
 outheast MTH Great HallThursday\, April 16: Cascade 2nd Floor Lobby &amp\
 ; Rooms 202\, 203\, 204The division of Student Wellbeing\, Engagement and
  Belonging (SWEB) is hiring including:Associated Students of Portland Com
 munity CollegeCivic Leadership DevelopmentMulticultural CenterQueer Resou
 rce CenterStudent Basic Needs CenterStudent EngagementVeterans Resource C
