CREATED:20260113T212048Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260327T172107Z
UID:10005610-1776195000-1776200400@literary-arts.org
SUMMARY:Planet Money: Live
DESCRIPTION:Join the team behind the popular NPR podcast Planet Money to celebrate the publication of their new book\, PLANET MONEY: A Guide to the Economic Forces That Shape Your Life. \n\n\nBook author and longtime Planet Money contributor Alex Mayyasi and host Kenny Malone will bring Planet Money’s signature brand of storytelling to the stage and discuss some highlights from the new book\, including unlikely origin stories\, revealing truths about human behavior\, and insightful suggestions for navigating chaotic times drawn from the latest ideas in economics. Louis Lin and Jolyn Chen\, co-owners of Xiao Ye restaurant\, will be the special guests this evening. \n\n\nSelect tickets include a copy of the book and an exclusive Planet Money tote bag! \nEnter promo code MONEY to get $10 off Zone 1 tickets (discount applied in cart).
URL:https://literary-arts.org/event/planet-money-live/
LOCATION:The Reser\, 12625 SW Crescent St\,\, Beaverton\, OR\, 97005\, United States
CATEGORIES:Ticketed Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://literary-arts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Planet-Money-jacket.jpeg
END:VEVENT
