SUMMARY:Slamlandia - April
DESCRIPTION:Slamlandia is a poetry open mic and slam that meets every month at Literary Arts\, on the third Thursday. This mic provides a creative\, fun\, and welcoming space for all literary communities in Portland. We encourage poets new and old to come share their work. We strive towards a safe space for poets to read their own poetry\, witness others\, and participate in community. \nSlamlandia is hosted by Julia Gaskill. The featured poet for April is Arttistry. \n 
