 a-informed\, wellness-based workshop\, participants will be gently guided 
 to create their own blossoming tree scene on canvas using acrylic paints
 . The class emphasizes relaxation\, mindfulness\, and self-expression\, ma
 king it an ideal seasonal activity for reducing stress and nurturing creat
 ivity. No experience is needed—just a willingness to create and connect.
