X-SOURCE-ID:friends_of_trees_green_space
X-SOURCE:Friends Of Trees Green Space
DTSTART:20260418T154500Z
DTEND:20260418T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260403T022438Z
UID:33pi9bu4pdiguui76pnq8netp9@google.com
CREATED:20260123T230652Z
DESCRIPTION:Your help is needed to mulch hundreds of native plants that wer
 e planted this past winter at Hidden Falls Nature Park! We may also take ou
 t some weedy introduced plants\, if time allows. <u>Note: there will be no 
 tree-planting at this event\, and this can be physically-demanding work</u>
  (great for folks looking for a work out!).  Our stewardship events help to
  ensure the highest level of plant survival through the PNW dry summer mont
 hs ahead.<br><p><b>How do I register? </b>Register by filling out <b><a hre
 f="https://www.tfaforms.com/4840511?tfa_26=a0TPa00001Edi8j&tfa_2189=Hidden%
 20Falls%20Nature%20Park%20Stewardship\,%20Happy%20Valley&tfa_31=a0VPa00000D
 fdEA&tfa_45=%20at%20April%2018\,%202026%20at%208:45%20am&tfa_2190=2026-04-1
 8&tfa_49=3.25&tfa_886=Standard%20FOT&tfa_51=offsite" target="_blank"><u><u>
 <u>this quick form</u></u></u></a></b>.  Groups\, families\, and individual
 s welcome!</p><u></u><p><b>Please arrive by 8:45am</b> to find our tent and
  sign-in\, stewardship activities start promptly at 9:00am. We provide glov
 es\, tools\, and guidance. All you need to do is show up dressed for the we
 ather and wearing sturdy shoes or boots (no sandals of any kind\, please!) 
 and be ready to have fun!</p><p><b>Under age 18?</b> We request that youth 
 15 and under volunteer with a parent/guardian.  Youth 16 and older can volu
 nteer on their own and will need to hand us a <b><a href="https://friendsof
 trees.org/youthwaiver" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u>youth waiver
  form</u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></a></b> signed by their parent/guardi
 an.</p><p><b>Questions?  </b>Pl<u></u>ease check out our <a href="https://f
 riendsoftrees.org/volunteer-faq/" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><
 u><u><b><u>Volunteer FAQ webpage</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u
 ></u></a>.  Our team is also happy to assist! <a href="mailto:Volunteer@fri
 endsoftrees.org" target="_blank"><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><u><b><u>volunt
 eer@fr<u></u>iendsoftrees.or<u></u>g</u></b></u></u></u></u></u></u></u></u
 ></u></u></a> / 503-595-0213 We look forward to working together soon!</p><
 hr /><p>This event is in partnership with City of Happy Valley.</p>
