SUMMARY:Taming the Inbox: How to Keep Your Personal Email Under Control
DTSTART;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260420T230000Z
DTEND;TZID=UTC;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260421T003000Z
UID:699e6c094dacf581ff7dbe30@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you have thousands of unread emails? Is there a sense of dr
 ead whenever you open your inbox? Do you have trouble finding important em
 ails? Bring your personal device and learn how to organize and manage your
