  bias\, fat shame and weight-based oppression as a social justice issue t
 hat intersects with other systems of oppression.</p><p style="line-height
 : 1.6\;">  This course includes an introduction to the paradigm of Health
  At Every Size (HAES)\, a weight-neutral approach to health promotion tha
 t emphasizes size diversity\, intuitive eating\, and joyful movement. HAE
