DESCRIPTION:An astronaut finds herself marooned in deep space after a disa
 ster. As she works to effect a rescue\, she thinks back on the forces and 
 choices that led her to this place. This new interactive\, multi-media pla
 y gets a fully-staged premiere.
LOCATION:21ten Theatre\, 2110 SE 10th Ave\, Portland\, OR 97214
URL:https://fertilegroundpdx.org/
