  April 29th 7:00-8:30 pm\, Where: The North Plains Library\nSweet      Tre
 ats: Enjoy celebratory cupcakes.\nShared      History: A look back at the 
 stories and journeys that shaped us.\nA      Sparkling Surprise: You won
