X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Ohsu Library": "https://librarycalendar.ohsu.edu/event/16571477"}
X-SOURCE-ID:ohsu_library
X-SOURCE:Ohsu Library
DTSTART:20260501T190000Z
DTEND:20260501T200000Z
DTSTAMP:20260501T000000Z
SUMMARY:Supercharge Your Research with Scite AI
DESCRIPTION:Discover how Scite AI can elevate your research process by 
 combining the power of generative AI with a scholarly literature citation 
 database. This session introduces key features of Scite AI\, including the 
 Scite Assistant for summarizing literature\, Table mode for constructing 
 evidence tables\, and Dashboards for targeted literature analysis. Ethical 
 considerations and comparisons to similar tools will also be 
 addressed.\n\nLearning Objectives:\n\nAfter this session\, learners will be 
 able to:\n\n\n	Use Scite AI for research\n	\n		Discover literature using 
 citation searching\n		Summarize search results with the AI 
 Assistant\n		Query a specific body of literature using 
 Dashboards\n	\n	\n	Describe limitations of Scite and potential ethical 
 concerns \n	Compare Scite AI with similar tools\n\n\nThis workshop will be 
 recorded\, and the recording will be shared with all registered attendees 
 after the session. If you cannot make the workshop date and time\, you are 
 welcome to register in order to receive a copy of the recording.
LOCATION:Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="Brandon Wilkinson":MAILTO:wilkinbr@ohsu.edu
CATEGORIES:AI
UID:LibCal-6248-16571477
URL:https://librarycalendar.ohsu.edu/event/16571477
END:VEVENT
