 ><strong>Caroline McGrath\, LPC\, NCC</strong> is a Licensed Professional
  Counselor\, Certified Trauma-Informed Breathwork and HypnoBreathwork Fac
 ilitator\, Certified Somatic Jungian Coach\, and Certified TRE® Provider
 . She is the founder of Soul of the Lotus®\, a practice devoted to somat
 ic healing\, depth psychology\, and embodied transformation.</p><p style=
 "line-height: 1.5\;">  Caroline's work integrates clinical counseling\, n
 ervous system regulation\, breathwork\, and inner child–informed approa
 ches to support deep\, lasting change. She works with college students\, 
 young adults\, and midlife women navigating anxiety\, identity shifts\, a
 nd life transitions.</p><p style="line-height: 1.5\;">  In addition to he
 r clinical practice\, she leads professional trainings for therapists and
  helping professionals\, as well as retreats and transformational program
 s for midlife women. Her teaching emphasizes experiential learning\, trau
 ma-informed practice\, and practical somatic tools that clinicians can co
 nfidently integrate into their work.</p><div id="lw_widget_470b39ba" clas
 s="lw_widget lw_widget_type_blurbs lw_widget_blurbs lw_widget_id_3994 lw_
