SUMMARY:Build and Maintain Your Scholarship Profile for Promotion
DESCRIPTION:In this hands‑on workshop\, you’ll learn how to track\, 
 update\, and present your publications and research activities in ways that 
 support your promotion. We’ll introduce easy‑to‑use tools that help 
 you manage your research profile and show you how to complete key tasks in 
 each one. You’ll leave with practical skills you can use right away to 
 make your work easier to find and understand.
