UID:5245@japanesegarden.org
DTSTART:20260808T173000Z
DTEND:20260808T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260223T233826Z
URL:https://japanesegarden.org/events/family-studio-2026-08-08/
SUMMARY:Storytime in the Family Studio - Forest Bathing Week
DESCRIPTION:[caption id="attachment_46033" align="alignnone" width="788"] Storytime in the Family Studio.[/caption]\n\nJoin us in the Family Studio for a joyful community storytime celebrating Japanese culture and the power of nature to spark curiosity and wonder.\n\nPerfect for families and young readers\, this event features a selection of stories especially chosen for children aged 3 to 8\, but all ages are welcome to enjoy the fun! One Saturday each month\, come share in the joy of storytelling through a new theme inspired by Portland Japanese Garden’s cultural festivals and community programs.\n\nAugust’s Forest Bathing storytime takes kids into nature\, with books that encourage slowing down\, noticing the world around us\, and finding calm in the outdoors.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://wpmedia.japanesegarden.org/w:2560/h:1707/q:mauto/process:46033/id:d59fb65c66a56c4b2fd04a10579b6565/https://japanesegarden.org/2025_09_13_StoryTimeFamilyStudio_PhotoByPJG-20.jpg
CATEGORIES:Family
LOCATION:Lemelson Studio\, 611 SW Kingston Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97205\, United States
