X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Japanese Garden": "https://japanesegarden.org/events/family-studio-2026-09-26/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:japanese_garden
X-SOURCE:Japanese Garden
UID:5246@japanesegarden.org
DTSTART:20260926T173000Z
DTEND:20260926T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260223T233910Z
URL:https://japanesegarden.org/events/family-studio-2026-09-26/
SUMMARY:Storytime in the Family Studio - Moonviewing
DESCRIPTION:[caption id="attachment_46033" align="alignnone" width="788"] Storytime in the Family Studio.[/caption]\n\nJoin us in the Family Studio for a joyful community storytime celebrating Japanese culture and the power of nature to spark curiosity and wonder.\n\nPerfect for families and young readers\, this event features a selection of stories especially chosen for children aged 3 to 8\, but all ages are welcome to enjoy the fun! One Saturday each month\, come share in the joy of storytelling through a new theme inspired by Portland Japanese Garden’s cultural festivals and community programs.\n\nAs we celebrate Moonviewing at the Garden\, September’s storytime invites children to explore the quiet moments of wonder that nature provides.
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://wpmedia.japanesegarden.org/w:2560/h:1707/q:mauto/process:46033/id:d59fb65c66a56c4b2fd04a10579b6565/https://japanesegarden.org/2025_09_13_StoryTimeFamilyStudio_PhotoByPJG-20.jpg
CATEGORIES:Family
LOCATION:Lemelson Studio\, 611 SW Kingston Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97205\, United States
